OL,3,GNEWSAHelicopter jobs at risk despite
OL,4,A#1bn contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 75 jobs could be lost at a
OL,7,Fhelicopter factory just months after a
OL,8,Fmajor new government contract was
OL,9,Fsigned.
OL,11,FLeonardo Helicopters announced a
OL,12,Frestructure of its final assembly line
OL,13,Fin Yeovil, Somerset, on Thursday, which
OL,14,Fit said could result in a reduction in
OL,15,Froles.
OL,17,FThis comes after the company was
OL,18,Fawarded a #1bn contract to build 23 new
OL,19,Fmedium helicopters for the Ministry of
OL,20,FDefence (MoD), which was said to have
OL,21,Fprotected the factory's 3,000 jobs.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
