OL,3,GNEWSAHelicopter jobs at risk despite
OL,4,A#1bn contract
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the company said it had made the
OL,7,F"difficult decision" to restructure
OL,8,Fstaffing on its assembly line due to "a
OL,9,Fshort-term workload deficit", adding it
OL,10,Fwould work to "minimise job losses".
